<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo says in $200 mln cargo ship deals.</title>
<headline>Daewoo says in $200 mln cargo ship deals.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daewoo Heavy Industries Ltd said on Wednesday it has finalised two deals, valued at a total $200 million, to sell three cargo vessels to a Canadian and one to a U.S. firm.</p>
</text>
